        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are developing GaN technologies capable of supporting higher power output than today’s GaN devices, with an aim of developing products to address power-switching modules in EV drivetrains, which currently incorporate SiC and IGBT modules.",
