        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since then, we have introduced a variety of new products utilizing GaN technology and developed new generations of our GaN technology capable of supporting voltages as high as 1700 volts.",
