        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing additional products incorporating GaN transistors, which we believe will enable us to address higher-power applications than we address with our current range of products, and further expand our SAM as discussed above.",
